### 1. 学生登录：运行成功后自动保存 JWT 到全局变量 student_token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentNo": "test_student_001",
  "password": "TestPass_12345"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("student_token", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 2. 查询当前登录学生的购物车
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 3. 添加菜品到当前登录学生的购物车
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dishId": 1,
  "quantity": 1
}

### 修改宫保鸡丁数量为 3
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/cart/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 3
}

### 删除购物车中的宫保鸡丁
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/cart/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}